---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../config';
const link = 'color: var(--signal-ink);border-bottom: 1px solid var(--signal-ink)';
---
<Base title="Check your email" description="We sent a link to confirm your place on the Knowware pre-order list." noindex>
  <section class="kw-section" aria-labelledby="listed-h">
    <p class="kw-label">Pre-order list</p>
    <h1 class="kw-h2" id="listed-h">Check your email.</h1>
    <p class="kw-body">If that address can receive mail, a link is on its way. Press the button in it to confirm your place. You are not on the list until you do, and it is the only email you will get before pre-orders open. Nothing shared. To be removed, write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} style={link}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <p class="kw-body" style="margin-top:16px"><a href="/read" style={link}>Read Chapter 1 free →</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
